/* Gn034: B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS degree-2 6-CP: knot vector (0.0,0.0,0.0,0.5,0.500000000001,1.0,1.0,1.0) — consecutive interior knots 0.5 and 0.500000000001 differ by 1e-12 (below parametric epsilon); IEEE-754 non-empty interval rounds to zero in spline evaluation routines producing NaN or unstable derivatives; C-1 positional break at t=0.5 (1.5-unit CP gap) also present to drive shape_null=True */
